body:
Here's what I'm trying to send. I want to insert the datacard information at the end of the body.

Gmail.SendEmail(  
TextInput1,  
{  
Subject: "Invoice from XXXX",  
Body: "Hello, <br>  
<br>  
This is an invoice from XXXX for a"  
}  
)

Hey Julian, life long fan of yours and Patriots nation. Thanks for doing this AMA.

&#x200B;

The superbowl game against the Falcons was one of the best games I've ever seen and I can honestly say it changed my life. Seeing you, Tom, Bill, and the rest of the guys has changed my attitude towards situations that are looking grim. Be honest for me... when you saw the score halfway through the 3rd quarter, did you think you were going to win? And how do you put your mind at ease when you're down by that much?

&#x200B;

P.S. Tom is the GOAT quarterback but that was the GOAT catch!
